# shell: both
# PVL-025/PVL-098: a folder made from the context menu appears where the
# menu was opened, not wherever auto-placement puts the next icon.
key 1 ctrl
wait 8
note the context menu is opened over an empty part of the window
press 400 250 3
wait 2
release 400 250 3
wait 5
menu-pick New folder
wait 20
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/New folder
note and the icon for it sits where the menu was opened, rather than in the
note next free slot of the grid
expect-icon-screen New folder 400 250
quit
